{"version":1,"content":"<p>啟德德朗邨發生謀殺案。</p><p>一名年約90歲老婦昨日（11日）在德瑤樓單位內暈倒昏迷送院，經搶救後不治。</p><p>警方初步調查懷疑事主曾被人襲擊，拘捕涉案外籍女傭。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:55.879930+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":75,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T07:18:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T07:57:40.035547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:42.170850+00:00","content_hash":"29d8bbfb763f8ea1a76d156d02b868f21cf4709ab312e253f30135a98285808a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}